#. ~ Description for heavy combat exoskeleton
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Colloquially known as a 'tank suit' in the media, these bulky exoskeletons, "
"covered in thick segmented armor plates, were tested in military service a "
"few years back and determined to be too heavy and expensive for regular use."
"  Now that it's in your hands, though, you have a massive suit of power "
"armor capable of resisting almost any small arms fire and most other forms "
"of attack.  On the other hand, it doubles your effective weight, and it's "
"almost impossible not to bump into things.  There is an integrated chemical "
"resistant bodyglove that precludes wearing other clothing.  The armor is "
"outfitted with a variety of clips & clamps, allowing it to hold a few mags &"
" grenades, as well as a large rifle"
msgstr ""

