"This is an inactive turret.  Using this item involves loading the unit with "
"the factory-loaded ball pistol ammunition in your inventory (if you wish to "
"divide your ammunition, set aside whatever ammo you do NOT want to give the "
"turret) turning it on, and placing it on the ground.  If reprogrammed and "
"rewired successfully the turret will then identify you as a friendly, and "
"attack all enemies with its SMG."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for inactive TALON UGV
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an inactive TALON UGV equipped with an assault rifle.  Using this "
"item involves loading the unit with the factory-loaded ball rifle ammo in "
"inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition, set aside whatever rifle "
"ammo you do NOT want to give the robot) turning it on, and placing it on the"
" ground.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the security bot will "
"then identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and attack all "
"enemies with its rifle."
msgstr ""

