"someone who can remove it.  Can you even sleep, for fear of death?"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Engineered Deep Sea Explorer"
msgstr "Sztucznie stworzony badacz głębin"

#. ~ Profession (male Engineered Deep Sea Explorer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Created with the exploration of the deep sea in mind, Cecaelia are "
"hybridized from cephalopod and fish DNA.  While you were mostly spared from "
"the corporate wars by your scientific proclivities, the polite niceties of "
"the surface are mostly forgotten underwater.  You were on dry land when the "
"Cataclysm occurred and you have no idea if it's safer here or beneath the "
"seas."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Engineered Deep Sea Explorer"
msgstr "Sztucznie stworzona badaczka głębin"

#. ~ Profession (female Engineered Deep Sea Explorer) description
