msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the aliens came, but now you've got nothing left "
"except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession (female Landscaper) description
